OL,3,GNEWSASheep stolen from Clarkson's
OL,4,ADiddly Squat Farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of sheep have been stolen from
OL,7,FDiddly Squat Farm belonging to
OL,8,Fpresenter Jeremy Clarkson.
OL,10,FWhen asked about the incident at
OL,11,FClarkson's farm, Thames Valley Police
OL,12,Fconfirmed it received reports on
OL,13,FWednesday that the animals had been
OL,14,Ftaken from a farm in Chadlington,
OL,15,FOxfordshire within the last 10 days.
OL,17,FNo arrests have been made and the force
OL,18,Fhas appealed for anyone with
OL,19,Finformation to contact them.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
