OL,3,GNEWSASheep stolen from Clarkson's
OL,4,ADiddly Squat Farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FClarkson, 66, told The Sun he
OL,7,Fdiscovered the animals were missing
OL,8,Fwhen he went to count his flock with
OL,9,FClarkson's Farm co-star Kaleb Cooper.
